* @title Returning a variable with NRETURN
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 4
* @expect >>>
* FIRST SECOND
* <<<
         DEFINE('NEXT(A)')                    :(N_END)
NEXT     A<0> = A<0> + 1
         NEXT = .A<A<0>>                      :(NRETURN)
N_END    B = ARRAY('0:10')
         NEXT(B) = 'FIRST'
         NEXT(B) = 'SECOND'
         OUTPUT = B<1> ' ' B<2>
END
